v 3
d 'SURVEYCLEAN': module providing survey data tools
d
d  surveyclean bundles four tools for checking a complex-survey
d  dataset before svyset: wtcheck (validate survey weights),
d  stratdx (check strata/PSU design structure), benchmark (compare
d  sample shares to known population shares), and trimwt (trim/cap
d  extreme survey weights).
d
d KW: survey data
d KW: sampling weights
d KW: complex survey design
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260830
d
d Author: Your Name
d Support: email your.email@example.com

f surveyclean.ado
f surveyclean_wtcheck.ado
f surveyclean_stratdx.ado
f surveyclean_benchmark.ado
f surveyclean_trimwt.ado
f surveyclean.sthlp
